entries[219501] = { ["name"] = "Vambraces of Deepening Darkness", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nWrist Mail\n2317 Armor\n+1,198 [Agility or Intellect]\n+5,483 Stamina\n+ 351 Versatility\n+ 468 Mastery\nDurability 55 / 55\nEquip: Dealing damage has a chance to grant you a stack of Deepening Darkness. The Darkness erupts at 5 stacks, dealing ( 1 * 161232 ) Shadow damage split among all nearby enemies. Damage increases per target, up to 5. Afterwards, the shadows weigh you down and lower your movement speed by 15% for 5 sec.\n\nThis is a Nerubian embellishment.\nSell Price:" }
